1
00:00:06,983 --> 00:00:08,863
(Sheldon:)Wolowitz is trying to outflank us.

2
00:00:09,026 --> 00:00:12,316
(Sheldon:)Let out some string, add altitude,
I'll go under and cut his line.

3
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:15,114
(Leonard:)Why wouldn't Penny
want her friends to meet me?

4
00:00:15,283 --> 00:00:16,573
(Sheldon:)Focus, Leonard, focus.

5
00:00:16,742 --> 00:00:20,742
(Sheldon:)The heat of battle is upon us.
The dogs of war are unleashed.

6
00:00:20,913 --> 00:00:23,873
(Leonard:)Maybe Koothrappali's right,
maybe I embarrass her.

7
00:00:24,041 --> 00:00:25,331
(Sheldon:)You're embarrassing me.

8
00:00:25,501 --> 00:00:27,461
(Sheldon:)A grown man worrying
about such nonsense.

9
00:00:27,628 --> 00:00:30,128
We're in the middle of flying kites.

10
00:00:31,424 --> 00:00:34,344
(Sheldon:)-Sorry.
-Sorry won't bring their kites down.

11
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:37,050
Ouch! String burn. String burn.

12
00:00:39,599 --> 00:00:42,889
(Raj:)Oh, they think we're flanking.
They're playing right into our hands.

13
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:45,650
At the count of three,
we execute the flying scissor.

14
00:00:45,813 --> 00:00:48,853
-One, two, thre--
-Whoa.

15
00:00:49,025 --> 00:00:50,355
(Howard:)-You see that?
-See what?

16
00:00:50,526 --> 00:00:52,816
(Howard:)-That chick. She smiled at me.
-No, she didn't.

17
00:00:52,987 --> 00:00:54,947
(Raj:)-She did.
-Come on, scissors, scissors.

18
00:00:55,114 --> 00:00:58,034
(Howard:)-Hold my line.
-What? I can't scissors by myself.

19
00:00:58,201 --> 00:01:00,531
Howard, come back!

20
00:01:00,786 --> 00:01:03,026
SHELDON:
Victory!

